{"id": "DeecMf9nBBn", "title": "Video by index.opensource", "description": "Demucs separates a song into drums, bass, vocals, and the rest.\n\nWe ran its htdemucs model on Josh Woodward\u2019s \u201cKnock.\u201d The video plays each separated track, then compares the estimated accompaniment with the instrumental version the musician released.\n\nInside, Demucs reads the same sound as a waveform and a spectrogram. Both branches compress the input, exchange information through a transformer, and expand it back into four tracks. Their estimates are added together.\n\nThe sounds are actual Demucs outputs. We made the visualizations from the audio and the model\u2019s internal values. Some sound still leaks between tracks.\n\nWhich part would you listen to first: the bass line, the drum pattern, or the vocal?\n\nDemucs\ub294 \ub178\ub798 \ud55c \uace1\uc744 \ub4dc\ub7fc, \ubca0\uc774\uc2a4, \ubcf4\uceec, \ub098\uba38\uc9c0 \uc18c\ub9ac\ub85c \ub098\ub220 \uc90d\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nJosh Woodward\uc758 \u201cKnock\u201d\uc744 htdemucs \ubaa8\ub378\ub85c \ubd84\ub9ac\ud588\uc5b4\uc694. \uc601\uc0c1\uc5d0\uc11c \uac01 \ud2b8\ub799\uc744 \ud558\ub098\uc529 \ub4e3\uace0, Demucs\uac00 \ucd94\uc815\ud55c \ubc18\uc8fc\ub97c \uc791\uac00\uac00 \uacf5\uac1c\ud55c \ubc18\uc8fc\ud310\uacfc \ube44\uad50\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nDemucs\ub294 \uac19\uc740 \uc18c\ub9ac\ub97c \ud30c\ud615\uacfc \uc2a4\ud399\ud2b8\ub85c\uadf8\ub7a8, \ub450 \ubc29\uc2dd\uc73c\ub85c \uc77d\uc5b4\uc694. \ub450 \uac08\ub798\uac00 \uc785\ub825\uc744 \uc555\ucd95\ud558\uace0, \ud2b8\ub79c\uc2a4\ud3ec\uba38\ub85c \uc815\ubcf4\ub97c \uc8fc\uace0\ubc1b\uc740 \ub4a4 \ub2e4\uc2dc \ub124 \ud2b8\ub799\uc73c\ub85c \ud3bc\uce69\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub9c8\uc9c0\ub9c9\uc5d0\ub294 \ub450 \uac08\ub798\uc758 \ucd94\uc815\uac12\uc744 \ub354\ud574\uc694.\n\n\ub4e4\ub9ac\ub294 \uc18c\ub9ac\ub294 \uc2e4\uc81c Demucs \ucd9c\ub825\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc18c\ub9ac\uc640 \ubaa8\ub378 \ub0b4\ubd80 \uac12\uc744 \uc77d\uc5b4 \uc2dc\uac01\ud654\ud588\uc5b4\uc694. \ud2b8\ub799 \uc0ac\uc774\uc5d0 \ub2e4\ub978 \uc18c\ub9ac\uac00 \uc77c\ubd80 \ub0a8\uae30\ub3c4 \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\ubca0\uc774\uc2a4 \ub77c\uc778, \ub4dc\ub7fc \ud328\ud134, \ubcf4\uceec \uc911 \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uc18c\ub9ac\ubd80\ud130 \ub530\ub85c \ub4e4\uc5b4 \ubcf4\uace0 \uc2f6\uc73c\uc2e0\uac00\uc694?", "channel": "index.opensource", "uploader_id": "60040254965", "uploader": "index.opensource", "timestamp": 1791982802, "like_count": 3585, "comment_count": 45, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1849779162850086a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 63.308, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP78vbmpeYvK6eNAZpvLDThcpgCKtP9wm0bKdX37UzgKjZ9-q-ZMYuGLbRTDh3yI6pgZ5X4YXLFl_-byGblO-D0y4k6jHAc6MYAPik.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=WsUYQ7Px-HgQ7kNvwEmO1Ja&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=V8vo-wz6sr0_EBYRPkEGdw&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQPrFW3zxmlHIUSuh1ESyIgrVBbZx-9YMuwMbneUqDd3dw&oe=6AE22D4A", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 63.308, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": null, "filesize_approx": null, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us